                    <msContents>
                        <summary>Tārika Walda ʾAmid, Ḥassabāt, chronological texts</summary>
                        <msItem xml:id="ms_i1">
                            <locus from="2ra" to="3rc"/>
                            <title>Table of contents of Philoxenus of Mabbog</title>
                            <note>List of 176 chapters without relation to the following content, apparently an incomplete table of contents of
                                <ref type="work" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT1399Filkes">Filkǝsyos</ref>.</note>
                            <incipit xml:lang="gez">አርእስተ፡ ዝንቱ፡ መጽሐፍ። ፩፡ በእንተ፡ ብሕቱና፡ እማኅበር፡ ዘከመ፡ ይኄይስ። ፪፡ በእንተ፡ አስብ፡ መጠነ፡ ሕሊና። ፫፡ በከመ፡
                                ይኄይስ፡ ምንኵስና፡ እምሕዝባዊያን።</incipit>
                            <explicit xml:lang="gez">፻፸፭፡ ንስማዕኬ፡ መንከረ፡ በእንተ፡ እንጦንዮስ። ፻፸፮፡ <cb n="3rc"/> በእንተ፡ ብርሃን።</explicit>
                        </msItem>
                        <msItem xml:id="ms_i2">
                            <locus from="4ra" to="84vc"/>
                            <title type="incomplete" ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT6936TarWaAmidBeta">Tārika Walda ʾAmid (β-recension)</title>
                            <note>Covering the time from the creation until Emperor Tiberius.</note>
                            <incipit xml:lang="gez">በስመ፡ እግዚአብሔር፡ መሓሪ፡ ወመስተሣህል፡ እትረዳእ፡ ወእዌጥን፡ ጽሕፈተ፡ ታሪክ፡ ዘውእቱ፡ ዜናሆሙ፡ ለአበው፡ ቀደምት፡
                                ወሐሳበ፡ ኆልቈ፡ መዋዕሊሆሙ፡ ለነገሥት፡ እምአዳም፡ እስከ፡ ተፍጻሜቶሙ፡ ለእስራኤል፡ ወለአሕዛብ፡ 
                                <supplied reason="omitted">ዘ</supplied>አስተጋብኦ፡ አብ፡ ክቡር፡ ወትሩፍ፡ ክርስቶሳዊ፡ ጊዮርጊስ፡ ወልደ፡ ዓሚድ፡ ዘብሔረ፡ ግብጽ። 
                                ወሰላመ፡ እግዚአብሔር፡ የሀሉ፡ ላዕለ፡ ገብሩ፡ ንጉሥነ፡ ኢያሱ፡ ለዓለመ፡ ዓለም፡ አሜን።</incipit>
                            <explicit xml:lang="gez">ወይቤ፡ ካዕበ፡ በእንቲአሁ፡ እስመ፡ ውእቱ፡ ቃለ፡ እዋጺ፡ ዘይጸርሖ፡ በገዳም፡ ወይብል፡ እስተጸልው፡ ወጺሑእ፡ ፍኖቶ፡
                                ለእግዚአብሔር፡ ወዓርዩ፡ መጽያሕቶ።</explicit>
                        </msItem>
                        <msItem xml:id="ms_i3">
                            <locus from="86ra" to="100va"/>
                            <title ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT7561HassabaHeg">Ḥassāba ḥǝggu la-ʾƎgziʾabǝḥer</title>
                            <note>Some events from Ethiopian history are mentioned at times partly in form of later additions, e.g. 
                                <foreign xml:lang="gez">ወበዝየ፡ ሞተ፡ አቃቤ፡ ሰዓት፡<persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS14938Abranyos">አብራንዮስ።</persName></foreign>, 
                                who is possibly the mamhǝr of Kǝbrān, promoted to the rank of the ʾaqābe saʿāt.</note>
                            <incipit xml:lang="gez">በስመ፡ አብ፡ <gap reason="ellipsis"/> ናሁ፡ ጸሐፍነ፡ በረድኤተ፡ እግዚአብሔር፡ ፈጣሪ፡ ሕያው፡ ተናጋሪ፡ ከሃሊ፡ ወገባሪ፡
                                ሐሳበ፡ ሕጉ፡ ለእግዚአብሔር፡ ዘተሠርዐ፡ በአበው፡ ቀደምት፡ ክቡራን፡ ወነበያት፡ ቅዱሳን፡ ወሐዋርያት፡ ንጹሓን፡</incipit>
                        </msItem>
                        <msItem xml:id="ms_i4">
                            <locus from="100va" to="103rc"/>
                            <title ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT4104Sematat">Prophecies and witnesses on Christ</title>
                            <incipit xml:lang="gez">እሉ፡ ስምዓታት፡ ዘያሌብው፡ መሊሕናሁ፡ ለመድኅነ፡ ዓለም፡ ክርስቶስ። ይቤ፡ 
                                <persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS3814Enoch">ሄኖክ፡</persName></incipit>
                        </msItem>
                        <msItem xml:id="ms_i5">
                            <locus from="103rc" to="104va"/>
                            <title>An Amharic text on questions of faith</title>
                            <incipit xml:lang="am">ፍጥረት፡ በምን፡ ወርኅ፡ ተፈጥረ። በመጋቢት።</incipit>
                        </msItem>
                        <msItem xml:id="ms_i6">
                            <locus from="104vb" to="105vc"/>
                            <title type="incomplete" ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT3081RepCh361">Hymn to St Michael</title>
                            <note>Erroneously described as 'Salām an Gabriel' in <bibl corresp="http://zotero.org/groups/358366/items/94MIBVB3"><seg type="book"><!-- attributes from original bibl--></seg><ptr target="bm:Hammerschmidt1973Tanasee"/><title level="m">Äthiopische Handschriften vom Ṭānāsee&lt;hi rend="italics"&gt;, I:&lt;/hi&gt; Reisebericht und Beschreibung der Handschriften in dem Kloster des Heiligen Gabriel auf der Insel Kebrān</title><title level="s">Verzeichnis der orientalischen Handschriften in Deutschland</title><author><forename>Ernst</forename><surname>Hammerschmidt</surname></author><pubPlace>Wiesbaden</pubPlace><publisher>Franz Steiner Verlag GmbH</publisher><date>1973</date><series><title level="s">Verzeichnis der orientalischen Handschriften in Deutschland</title><biblScope unit="volume">20/1</biblScope></series><biblScope unit="volume">20/1</biblScope><note type="tags"><note type="tag">Cataloguing</note><note type="tag">Ethiopic</note><note type="tag">Tanasee1</note><note type="tag">bm:Hammerschmidt1973Tanasee</note></note><note type="tag">Cataloguing</note><note type="tag">Ethiopic</note><note type="tag">Tanasee1</note><note type="tag">bm:Hammerschmidt1973Tanasee</note><citedRange unit="page">207</citedRange></bibl>.</note>
                            <incipit xml:lang="gez">ሰላም፡ ለገጽከ፡ ሐፈ፡ ሞገስ፡ ዘተቀብዓ፡ ወለአእዛኒከ፡ ጽልው፡ ገዓረ፡
                                ምንዱባን፡ ዘስምኣ፡ ሚካኤል፡ መልአኩ፡</incipit>
                        </msItem>
                        <msItem xml:id="ms_i7">
                            <locus from="105vc" to="106vc"/>
                            <title ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT2869RepCh150">Malkǝʾ-hymn to Walatta Ṗeṭros</title>
                            <incipit xml:lang="gez">በስመ፡ አብ፡ <gap reason="illegible"/>ውስተ፡ ልብየ፡ ወለተ፡ ጴጥሮስ፡ ምእመን፡ <unclear>ይዳለ፡</unclear>
                                አእምሮ፡ ንስቲተ፡ ሲኖዳ፡ ካህን። ሰላም፡ ለዝክረ፡ ስምኪ፡ ዘቃጸላ፡ ሞገሰ፡ ትርሲቱ፡</incipit>
                        </msItem>
                        <msItem xml:id="ms_i8">
                            <locus from="107ra" to="109ra"/>
                            <title ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT1195Bahrah">Treatise about the calculation of astronomical-chronological elements</title>
                            <note>Similar to <ref type="mss" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/Tanasee34">Ṭānāsee 34, fol. 161</ref>.</note>
                        </msItem>
                        <msItem xml:id="ms_i9">
                            <locus target="#109ra"/>
                            <title>List of Arabic months</title>
                            <note>Possibly related to <ref type="work" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT6251Months">Names of the months in Greek, Latin and Syriac</ref>.</note>
                        </msItem>
                        <msItem xml:id="ms_i10">
                            <locus from="109ra" to="109vb"/>
                            <title>Chronology from Adam to Emperor Susǝnyos</title>
                            <note>Chronology with an indication on <locus target="109va"/> concerning the date of production of the text: 
                                <foreign xml:lang="gez">ወኮነ፡ ኵሉ፡ ዓመተ፡ ምሕረት፡ እምአዳም፡ እስከ፡ ዝየ፡ 
                                <date notBefore="1662" notAfter="1663" when-custom="7155" calendar="creation">፸፻ወ፩፻ወ፶፭፡ ዓመት።</date></foreign>.
                                According to <bibl corresp="http://zotero.org/groups/358366/items/94MIBVB3"><seg type="book"><!-- attributes from original bibl--></seg><ptr target="bm:Hammerschmidt1973Tanasee"/><title level="m">Äthiopische Handschriften vom Ṭānāsee&lt;hi rend="italics"&gt;, I:&lt;/hi&gt; Reisebericht und Beschreibung der Handschriften in dem Kloster des Heiligen Gabriel auf der Insel Kebrān</title><title level="s">Verzeichnis der orientalischen Handschriften in Deutschland</title><author><forename>Ernst</forename><surname>Hammerschmidt</surname></author><pubPlace>Wiesbaden</pubPlace><publisher>Franz Steiner Verlag GmbH</publisher><date>1973</date><series><title level="s">Verzeichnis der orientalischen Handschriften in Deutschland</title><biblScope unit="volume">20/1</biblScope></series><biblScope unit="volume">20/1</biblScope><note type="tags"><note type="tag">Cataloguing</note><note type="tag">Ethiopic</note><note type="tag">Tanasee1</note><note type="tag">bm:Hammerschmidt1973Tanasee</note></note><note type="tag">Cataloguing</note><note type="tag">Ethiopic</note><note type="tag">Tanasee1</note><note type="tag">bm:Hammerschmidt1973Tanasee</note><citedRange unit="page">207</citedRange></bibl>,
                                probably related to the text edited in <bibl corresp="http://zotero.org/groups/358366/items/E34B28PN"><seg type="journalArticle"><!-- attributes from original bibl--></seg><ptr target="bm:Grebaut1918Comput"/><title level="a">Table de comput et de chronologie</title><title level="j">Revue de l’Orient Chrétien</title><author><forename>Sylvain</forename><surname>Grébaut</surname></author><date>1918</date><biblScope unit="volume">21</biblScope><biblScope unit="page">323-330</biblScope><note type="tags"><note type="tag">bm:Grebaut1918Comput</note></note><note type="tag">bm:Grebaut1918Comput</note></bibl> and therefore possibly
                                related to <ref type="work" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT3851Hassab">We have written a computus that we will remember in order not to
        congregate with apostates...</ref>.</note>
                            <explicit xml:lang="gez">ስብሐት፡ ለእግዚአብሔር፡ ዘወሀቦሙ፡ ጥበበ፡ ወጸጋ፡ ከመ፡ ይክሥቱ፡ ወይጽሐፉ፡ ለነ፡ ለዝንቱ፡ ሐሳበ፡ ዘመን፡ እሉ፡ 
                                እሙንቱ፡ ቅዱስ፡ <persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS3500Demetriu">ድሜጥሮስ፡</persName> 
                                ወቅዱስ፡ <persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS1376Abusaker">አቡሻከር፡</persName> 
                                ወ<persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS4711Giyorgis">ጊዮርጊስ፡</persName> ጸሎቶሙ፡ ወጸጋ፡ 
                                ረ<supplied reason="subaudible" resp="CH">ድኤቱ፡ </supplied><gap reason="illegible"/>
                                <supplied reason="subaudible" rend="CH">ም</supplied>ስሌነ፡ 
                                አ<supplied reason="subaudible" rend="CH">ሜን።</supplied></explicit>
                         </msItem>
                        <msItem xml:id="ms_i11">
                            <locus from="110r" to="117r"/>
                            <title ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/NAR0003tables">Calendaric tables</title>
                            <note>Calendarical tables, similar to <ref type="mss" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/Tanasee34">Ṭānāsee 34, ff. 160-161</ref>.
                                The last folios are very dark and hardly legible in the digital reproduction.</note>
                        </msItem>
